# Axe the Competition (jeuno 59): the kind of each of Brutus's replies to a talk, against his script. Brutus has a
# script, so the lookup alternates an event-priority quest reply with it (UseFallback: an event sets it, his script's
# turn clears it), while a progressEvent plays whatever it holds. Here his script answers: Wings of Gold completed (a
# GM, before login), Scattered into Shadow not: 134. Wings of Gold's own completed reply, 134 (replaceDefault), loses
# to every reply of this quest. A level 75 Warrior with Axe 2400 and the Pick of Trials (0 points); Chocobo's Wounds
# and Save My Son completed, Path of the Beastmaster accepted (no accepted section), Chocobo on the Loose completed
# (no completed section) keep the others silent.
# The quest accepted with the guide (a GM): 15 (1) (the event sets UseFallback); again: his script's 134; the map (a
# GM): 16; again: his script's 134; 16; the Annals (a GM): 17 over UseFallback: completed. Completed: Wings of Gold's
# 134 (the quest's, UseFallback 0; it sets UseFallback); the quest set available (a GM): his script's 134 (a
# progressEvent 12 would play); 12 (oncePerZone), option 0; again: priority Ignore, his script's 134.
lists UpperJeuno/Brutus/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/12 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/15 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/17
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 job=WAR lvl=75
skill Axe 2400
item PickOfTrials
quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed
quest Jeuno.PathOfTheBeastmaster accepted
quest Jeuno.WingsOfGold completed
quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose completed
quest Jeuno.AxeTheCompetition accepted
keyitem WeaponTrainingGuide
login
trigger Brutus                          # accepted, the pick held: 15 (1) (UseFallback 0: the quest's; then 1)
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Brutus                          # UseFallback 1: his script's 134 (a progressEvent 15 would play); then 0
finish
keyitem MapToTheAnnalsOfTruth           # a GM
trigger Brutus                          # the map: 16 (UseFallback 0; then 1)
finish
trigger Brutus                          # his script's 134 (a progressEvent 16 would play)
finish
trigger Brutus                          # 16 (then UseFallback 1)
finish
keyitem AnnalsOfTruth                   # a GM
trigger Brutus                          # the Annals: 17, a progressEvent over UseFallback 1 (an event would give his script's 134)
finish                                  # completed: fame +7 x3, the three key items deleted, Decimation learned
trigger Brutus                          # completed: Wings of Gold's 134 (replaceDefault), UseFallback 0: the quest's; then 1
finish
quest Jeuno.AxeTheCompetition available # a GM
trigger Brutus                          # available, UseFallback 1: his script's 134 (a progressEvent 12 would play)
finish
trigger Brutus                          # 12 (oncePerZone; then UseFallback 1)
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Brutus                          # 12 played: priority Ignore; UseFallback 1: his script's 134
finish
